# Godot 4
.godot/
/android/
/build/
/export/

# Godot export presets often carry credentials (a keystore password, a signing identity) and are
# usually left untracked for that reason. export_presets.cfg is tracked in this repo because its
# only preset is Web, which carries none — a preset for a platform that does carry one belongs
# back on an ignore line, not beside this one in the tracked file.

# The baked atlas pages and their region table. A build output, not a source: tools/bake-atlases.sh
# rebuilds them from assets/atlases/membership.json and the pictures it names whenever a source
# hash changes, and every tool that needs them (check.sh, test.sh, run.sh, export-web.sh) calls it
# first. Committing them would be committing a derived file that nothing verifies and that every
# art change silently invalidates. The .import sidecars go with them, since a sidecar inside an
# ignored folder cannot be committed either — the bake writes them itself.
/assets/atlases/baked/

